# Windsurf Rules — <APP_NAME>

These rules instruct the Windsurf agent how to operate inside this
monorepo. They optimize for **reusing the LLM that ships with Windsurf**
(default: no OpenRouter API calls) by routing auto-fix work through
tickets created by `healing-webhook`.

